      "definition": "(a) \"Health benefit plan\" means a policy, contract, certificate, agreement, or other program offered to provide, deliver, arrange for, pay for, or reimburse any of the costs of health care services, including benefit plans marketed in the individual or group market by all associations, whether bona fide or non-bona fide. \"Health benefit plan\" also means a limited benefit plan.",
